                "type": "OUTPUT",
                "translations": {
                  "en_US": {
                    "text": "{J} You may [RUSH]. If you don't, target opponent [EXHAUSTED_RESUPPLIES]. (They put the top card of their deck in Reserve, then they exhaust it {T}. Rush means playing another card immediately.)",
                    "locale": "en_US"
                  },
                  "it_IT": {
                    "text": "{J} Puoi [RUSH]. Se non lo fai, un avversario bersaglio [EXHAUSTED_RESUPPLIES]. (Mette la prima carta del suo mazzo nella Riserva, poi la consuma {T}. Incalzare significa giocare un'altra carta immediatamente.)",
                    "locale": "it_IT"
                  },
                  "fr_FR": {
                    "text": "{J} Vous pouvez [RUSH]. Si vous ne le faites pas, un adversaire ciblé [EXHAUSTED_RESUPPLIES]. (Il met la première carte de son deck en Réserve, puis l'épuise {T}. Foncer signifie jouer une autre carte immédiatement.)",
                    "locale": "fr_FR"
                  },
                  "es_ES": {
                    "text": "{J} Puedes [RUSH]. Si no lo haces, el oponente objetivo [EXHAUSTED_RESUPPLIES]. (Tu oponente coloca la primera carta de su mazo en reserva y luego la agota {T}. Presionar es jugar otra carta inmediatamente.)",
                    "locale": "es_ES"
                  },
                  "de_DE": {
                    "text": "{J} Du darfst [RUSH] nutzen. Falls du das nicht tust, nutzt ein Gegner deiner Wahl [EXHAUSTED_RESUPPLIES]. (Er legt die oberste Karte seines Decks in die Reserve, dann erschöpft er sie {T}. Forcieren bedeutet, eine andere Karte sofort zu spielen.)",
                    "locale": "de_DE"
                  }
                },
                "text": "{J} You may [RUSH]. If you don't, target opponent [EXHAUSTED_RESUPPLIES]. (They put the top card of their deck in Reserve, then they exhaust it {T}. Rush means playing another card immediately.)"
